       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppnnmmccoommpp  was  obsoleted  by  ppaammccoommpp(1),  introduced  with Netpbm 10.21
       (March 2004).  ppaammccoommpp is backward compatible with ppnnmmccoommpp,  plus  adds
       many  additional  functions.   Among this is the ability to process PAM
       images, including those with transparency channels.

       ppnnmmccoommpp remained in the Netpbm package until  Netpbm  10.68  (September
       2014)  because  of hopes that it had fewer bugs than ppaammccoommpp because of
       its age.  But now it would just be clutter.

       In Netpbm before 10.21, use the manual for ppaammccoommpp with ppnnmmccoommpp.   Fea‐
       tures  that  are in ppaammccoommpp but not ppnnmmccoommpp are indicated by statements
       that they didn't exist before 10.21.

